{"seq":1,"slug":"ecommerce-recommendation","title":"电商推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-applications/ecommerce-recommendation","wordCount":1225,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"电商推荐\">电商推荐</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电商推荐（E-commerce Recommendation）是推荐系统在电子商务场景中的核心应用，通过个性化的商品推荐提升用户购物体验和平台转化效率。电商推荐涵盖首页推荐、搜索结果页推荐、商品详情页推荐和购物车推荐等多个场景，每个场景有不同的用户意图和推荐策略。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 电商推荐场景&#10;        HOME[首页推荐] --&gt; FEED[信息流]&#10;        HOME --&gt; GUESS[猜你喜欢]&#10;        SEARCH_R[搜索推荐] --&gt; RELATED[相关推荐]&#10;        SEARCH_R --&gt; SPONSORED[广告推荐]&#10;        DETAIL[详情页推荐] --&gt; SIMILAR[相似商品]&#10;        DETAIL --&gt; COMBO[搭配推荐]&#10;        CART_R[购物车推荐] --&gt; UPSELL[追加推荐]&#10;        CART_R --&gt; CROSS[交叉推荐]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 电商推荐场景\n        HOME[首页推荐] --&gt; FEED[信息流]\n        HOME --&gt; GUESS[猜你喜欢]\n        SEARCH_R[搜索推荐] --&gt; RELATED[相关推荐]\n        SEARCH_R --&gt; SPONSORED[广告推荐]\n        DETAIL[详情页推荐] --&gt; SIMILAR[相似商品]\n        DETAIL --&gt; COMBO[搭配推荐]\n        CART_R[购物车推荐] --&gt; UPSELL[追加推荐]\n        CART_R --&gt; CROSS[交叉推荐]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>用户意图</th>\n<th>推荐策略</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>特殊考虑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首页推荐</td>\n<td>浏览/发现</td>\n<td>兴趣匹配</td>\n<td>CTR, 时长</td>\n<td>多样性要求高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索推荐</td>\n<td>明确需求</td>\n<td>意图匹配</td>\n<td>CVR, GMV</td>\n<td>需理解搜索意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>详情页推荐</td>\n<td>比较/补充</td>\n<td>相似/互补</td>\n<td>加购率</td>\n<td>避免重复推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>购物车推荐</td>\n<td>即将购买</td>\n<td>搭配/凑单</td>\n<td>客单价</td>\n<td>价格敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付后推荐</td>\n<td>复购意向</td>\n<td>关联/周期</td>\n<td>复购率</td>\n<td>避免后悔推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多场景推荐架构\">多场景推荐架构</h2><p>电商平台通常需要支持数十个推荐场景，每个场景有不同的数据分布和业务目标。多场景推荐通过共享底层模型和特征来提升效率，同时为每个场景定制上层策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MultiSceneConfig {&#10;  scenes: SceneConfig[];&#10;  sharedModel: SharedModelConfig;&#10;  featureStore: FeatureStoreConfig;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SceneConfig {&#10;  sceneId: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  recallChannels: RecallChannel[];&#10;  rankModel: string;&#10;  reRankStrategy: string;&#10;  listSize: number;&#10;  diversityWeight: number;&#10;  businessRules: BusinessRule[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SceneSpecificModel {&#10;  sceneId: string;&#10;  expertNetwork: MLPLayer[];&#10;  gateNetwork: MLPLayer;&#10;  towerNetwork: MLPLayer[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function multiSceneRecommend(&#10;  userId: string,&#10;  sceneId: string,&#10;  context: RequestContext,&#10;  config: MultiSceneConfig,&#10;): Promise&lt;RecItem[]&gt; {&#10;  const sceneConfig = config.scenes.find((s) =&gt; s.sceneId === sceneId)!;&#10;  const userFeatures = await config.featureStore.getUserFeatures(userId);&#10;  const candidates = await multiChannelRecall(userId, sceneConfig.recallChannels);&#10;  const ranked = await sceneAwareRank(candidates, userFeatures, sceneId, config.sharedModel);&#10;  return applySceneReRank(ranked, sceneConfig);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiSceneConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scenes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SceneConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sharedModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SharedModelConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  featureStore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureStoreConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SceneConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sceneId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  recallChannels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RecallChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rankModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reRankStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  listSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  diversityWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  businessRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BusinessRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SceneSpecificModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sceneId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expertNetwork</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MLPLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  gateNetwork</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MLPLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  towerNetwork</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MLPLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiSceneRecommend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sceneId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequestContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiSceneConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RecItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sceneConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.scenes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.sceneId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sceneId)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.featureStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUserFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiChannelRecall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId, sceneConfig.recallChannels);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ranked</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sceneAwareRank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(candidates, userFeatures, sceneId, config.sharedModel);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> applySceneReRank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ranked, sceneConfig);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>STAR（Star Topology Adaptive Recommender）是阿里巴巴提出的多场景推荐模型，使用星型拓扑结构共享中心网络的参数，同时为每个场景维护独立的辅助网络。</p>\n<p>多场景推荐面临的核心挑战是场景之间的数据分布差异。首页推荐的用户以浏览为主，点击率相对较低但覆盖面广；搜索推荐的用户有明确的购买意图，转化率显著更高但流量较少。简单的模型共享会导致高流量场景主导模型训练，低流量场景效果不佳。STAR 通过场景特定的辅助网络解决这个问题，中心网络学习跨场景的通用知识，辅助网络捕获场景特有的分布模式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>多场景方法</th>\n<th>共享方式</th>\n<th>个性化方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>代表工作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>独立模型</td>\n<td>无共享</td>\n<td>完全独立</td>\n<td>场景隔离</td>\n<td>基线方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享底层</td>\n<td>底层 Embedding</td>\n<td>上层独立</td>\n<td>部分迁移</td>\n<td>Shared-Bottom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MMOE</td>\n<td>专家网络</td>\n<td>门控选择</td>\n<td>灵活选择</td>\n<td>Google MMOE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>STAR</td>\n<td>中心网络</td>\n<td>辅助网络调制</td>\n<td>知识共享+场景适配</td>\n<td>阿里 STAR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PLE</td>\n<td>共享+独立专家</td>\n<td>渐进抽取</td>\n<td>解决跷跷板</td>\n<td>腾讯 PLE</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"商品属性与搭配推荐\">商品属性与搭配推荐</h2><p>商品属性理解和搭配推荐是电商推荐的特色需求。商品之间的关系不仅有替代关系（相似商品），还有互补关系（搭配商品），推荐系统需要区分这两种关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type ItemRelation = &#39;substitute&#39; | &#39;complement&#39; | &#39;accessory&#39; | &#39;upgrade&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface ItemRelationPair {&#10;  item1: string;&#10;  item2: string;&#10;  relation: ItemRelation;&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;  source: &#39;co_purchase&#39; | &#39;co_view&#39; | &#39;expert&#39; | &#39;model&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeComplementScore(&#10;  item1: string,&#10;  item2: string,&#10;  coPurchaseData: Map&lt;string, Map&lt;string, number&gt;&gt;,&#10;  coViewData: Map&lt;string, Map&lt;string, number&gt;&gt;,&#10;): number {&#10;  const coPurchase = coPurchaseData.get(item1)?.get(item2) ?? 0;&#10;  const coView = coViewData.get(item1)?.get(item2) ?? 0;&#10;  const viewToPurchaseRatio = coPurchase / (coView + 1);&#10;  return viewToPurchaseRatio;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ItemRelation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'substitute'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'complement'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'accessory'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'upgrade'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ItemRelationPair</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  item1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  item2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  relation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ItemRelation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'co_purchase'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'co_view'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expert'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'model'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeComplementScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  item1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  item2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  coPurchaseData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  coViewData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coPurchase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coPurchaseData.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item1)?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item2) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coView</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coViewData.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item1)?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item2) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> viewToPurchaseRatio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coPurchase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (coView </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewToPurchaseRatio;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>搭配推荐的典型应用包括 &quot;购买了这件衬衫的用户还购买了这条领带&quot;（协同过滤搭配）、&quot;这件外套搭配推荐&quot;（时尚搭配模型）和 &quot;凑单推荐&quot;（基于价格和满减规则的组合优化）。</p>\n<p>凑单推荐是电商特有的推荐场景，当用户的购物车金额接近满减门槛时，系统推荐价格合适且用户可能感兴趣的商品帮助用户凑满减。这个问题可以建模为带约束的组合优化：在满足价格约束的前提下，最大化用户对推荐组合的兴趣得分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CouponMatchConfig {&#10;  threshold: number;&#10;  currentCartValue: number;&#10;  maxRecommendations: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function couponMatchRecommend(&#10;  gap: number,&#10;  candidates: Array&lt;{ itemId: string; price: number; score: number }&gt;,&#10;  config: CouponMatchConfig,&#10;): Array&lt;{ itemId: string; price: number; score: number }&gt; {&#10;  const eligible = candidates.filter((c) =&gt; c.price &gt;= gap * 0.8 &amp;&amp; c.price &lt;= gap * 1.5);&#10;  return eligible&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; {&#10;      const priceScoreA = 1 - Math.abs(a.price - gap) / gap;&#10;      const priceScoreB = 1 - Math.abs(b.price - gap) / gap;&#10;      return 0.6 * b.score + 0.4 * priceScoreB - (0.6 * a.score + 0.4 * priceScoreA);&#10;    })&#10;    .slice(0, config.maxRecommendations);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CouponMatchConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentCartValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxRecommendations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> couponMatchRecommend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  gap</sp